 "text": "Hi, I'm Nicolás, / a full-stack engineer from Córdoba, Argentina. / I've been writing code for six years, / five of them shipping React and TypeScript, / plus Python in two recent projects. / I like owning things end to end: / I led the full stack of Valley of Guardians, / a web game with more than ten thousand users, / and I'm the sole front-end developer of Doubland, / a live AI simulation. / I build with Claude Code and Codex every day, / with instructions, skills and subagents I set up myself, / and on my site I built the harness around a live model: / a voice robot with tools, / tested by a judge model. / Agents for real clinic workflows / is exactly the work I want to do next.",
